    "body": "This is very brittle each time a widget that deals with parameters is added we have to check if we have to ignore it or not. Even a user that manipulate the state could end up with an unwanted reset page. I don't have a solution be we should find one at some point. We could release with this solution but IMO it has to be temporary.",
